# P4 holding pen: the chuk settings pages a subagent copied verbatim before it
# died mid-adaptation. It lives OUTSIDE app/ on purpose: inside the Dart package
# `flutter analyze` would still walk it (the analyzer does not read .gitignore)
# and report its ~65 unresolved references. The P4-rest work adapts them from
# here into app/lib/pages/. Delete the folder and this rule when it is empty.
_p4_pending/
